WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.740
Watch and read: For your tracing practice, you are practising straight lines with a

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.685
pencil. What is the best answer?

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:12.544
The answer is: Follow the dotted line. Read the instruction carefully and choose the

00:00:12.544 --> 00:00:13.976
helpful or correct response.

00:00:14.783 --> 00:00:19.478
Watch and read: For your drawing practice, you need to draw a sun. What is the best

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:19.754
answer?

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:25.615
The answer is: A round centre with rays. Read the instruction carefully and choose

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:27.401
the helpful or correct response.
